{"book":"2-kings","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:20:44.748706390Z","verse":20,"ref":"2-kings 5:20","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":5,"translation":"And Gehazi, the servant of Elisha the man of Elohim, said, Behold, my lord has spared Naaman the Aramean, this ⟨one⟩, by not taking from his hand ⟨את⟩ what he brought. As YHWH lives, if I do not run after him and take from him ⟨את⟩ something!","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And said"},{"surface":"גיחזי","gloss":"Gehazi"},{"surface":"נער","gloss":"the servant"},{"surface":"אלישע","gloss":"of Elisha"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"the man"},{"surface":"האלהים","gloss":"of Elohim"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"Behold"},{"surface":"חשך","gloss":"has spared"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"my lord"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Naaman"},{"surface":"נעמן","gloss":"Naaman"},{"surface":"הארמי","gloss":"the Aramean"},{"surface":"הזה","gloss":"this one"},{"surface":"מקחת","gloss":"from taking"},{"surface":"מידו","gloss":"from his hand"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"what he brought"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"what"},{"surface":"הביא","gloss":"he brought"},{"surface":"חי","gloss":"lives"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"if"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"רצתי","gloss":"I run"},{"surface":"אחריו","gloss":"after him"},{"surface":"ולקחתי","gloss":"and take"},{"surface":"מאתו","gloss":"⟨את⟩ from him"},{"surface":"מאומה","gloss":"something"}]}